   L2737: is via the EU’s health agenda. Health actors have consistently taken an
>> L2738: interest in energy poverty, and the link between lack of access to energy
   L2739: and poor mental and physical health in people of all ages is well established
   L2740: (Heffner & Campbell, 2011). The EU’s public health mandate is rela-
